DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       ddnnsssseecc--ssiiggnnzzoonnee  signs  a zone; it generates NSEC and RRSIG records and
       produces a signed version of the zone. The security status  of  delega‐
       tions  from  the  signed zone (that is, whether the child zones are se‐
       cure) is determined by the presence or absence of  a  kkeeyysseett  file  for
       each child zone.

