       --uu     This option updates the NSEC/NSEC3 chain when re-signing a  pre‐
              viously  signed zone.  With this option, a zone signed with NSEC
              can be switched to NSEC3, or a zone signed  with  NSEC3  can  be
              switched  to NSEC or to NSEC3 with different parameters. Without
              this option, ddnnsssseecc--ssiiggnnzzoonnee retains  the  existing  chain  when
              re-signing.

       --vv lleevveell
              This option sets the debugging level.

       --xx     This  option  indicates that BIND 9 should only sign the DNSKEY,
